.TH HTTP_POST 3
.SH NAME
http_post \- start an HTTP POST request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <http.h>
.P
.BI "int http_post(http* " h ", const char* " location ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION

.BR http_post ()
is http_open(3) with the method POST. Without http_body(3) or http_chunk(3) the body is empty.
.SH RETURN VALUE
1 on success, 0 on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
http_open(3), http_chunk(3)
